    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65487" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγᾰλό-σπλαγχνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with enlarged abdomen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				53
			</span></i>; <i>with large viscera</i>, Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				21.7.6
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>causing the viscera to swell.</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος μ. σπληνὸς καὶ ἥπατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					50
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>high-spirited</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					109
				</span></i>
			 (anap.).</div>
